3%, energy -3%)</span>.<br/>Classification: 2 Tier: 0.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by knights and paladins of level 60 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 84.50 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It gives 3% ice protection, but increases damage taken from energy by 3%. Used to be very expensive, but the price decreased because <a href=\"#/wiki/Sea%20Serpent\">Sea Serpents</a> drop it.\n</p><p>Can be gotten out of a <a href=\"#/wiki/Mucus%20Plug\">Mucus Plug</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Animated%20Feather\">Animated Feather</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Armadile\">Armadile</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blight%20Mariner\">Blight Mariner</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Wolf\">Crystal Wolf</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Darklight%20Source\">Darklight Source</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Diamond%20Servant\">Diamond Servant</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Diamond%20Servant%20Replica\">Diamond Servant Replica</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Eradicator\">Eradicator</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghazbaran\">Ghazbaran</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Haunted%20Hunter\">Haunted Hunter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Overlord\">Ice Overlord</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Icecold%20Book\">Icecold Book</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Leviathan\">Leviathan</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Melting%20Frozen%20Horror\">Melting Frozen Horror</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Omrafir\">Omrafir</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Orewalker\">Orewalker</a></li>\n<li><a href